# RepGo – Project Rules for AI (Cursor)

## Single Source of Truth
- This project follows **Specification-Driven Development**.
- The canonical spec is `/docs/poc_spec_v2.md`. Always cite sections.
- KPIs: `/docs/kpi.md`
- ADRs: `/docs/adr/0001-architecture.md`
- (If available) Figma: <FIGMA_URL>

## Hard Rules
- Do **not** invent behavior outside the spec.
- If ambiguous, ask for clarification first.
- Enforce **"No dating intent"** copy where required by spec.
- Enforce **photo-required** gating for registration/profile.

## Implementation Conventions
- Use tokens from `apps/mobile/lib/design/tokens.gen.dart`.
- UI must match Figma spacing within ±4dp.
- State management: <Riverpod or Bloc> as chosen in ADR.
- Security: Supabase RLS policies as per spec.

## Output Format
- Return only changed files (full content) + a short “Changed files” summary.